  <History Date="13-01-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (very poor documentation.  contains errors.  made best guess)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="21-01-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Fayleung LED Strobe 960F (identical but with FX function range details)" Version="1" />
