  <History Date="29-08-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="6" />
  <History Date="21-11-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from AFX HYPER-STROBE-RGB+W (poor documentation.  FX ranges are not detailed properly.  assumed identical)" Version="7" />
  <History Date="22-05-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from QTX Light SpectraWash (documentation is utter nonsense.  assumed the same.  no function ranges.  no pixel layout.  'The first mock exam is the first mock exam.  Three in one mode'.   it is impressive that noone appears to have bothered to check or notice. hopeless)" Version="8" />
  <History Date="23-05-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's (currently missing 39 channel mode)" Version="9" />
  <History Date="24-05-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Atlabase ID for 39 channel mode." Version="10" />
  <History Date="03-06-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from BeamZ BS960 (identical.  same nonsense)" Version="11" />
  <History Date="25-10-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Hachidori LED Strobe Light RGB+W (FX ranges are not detailed properly and don't make any sense)" Version="12" />
